  "title": "Karen&#39;s Rolled Sugar Cookies",
  "description": "These classic cut-out cookies are easy when you use parchment paper to wrap and chill the dough, then roll out and bake the cookies.",
  "authors": [
    "Reynolds KitchensR"
  ],
